  "summary_en": "Japanese Cabinet Order (2000, as amended through August 2026) setting the organisation of the Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry: bureaus, divisions, agencies and their mandates. Robots appear only in passing, as Commerce and Information Policy Bureau jurisdiction over robot goods and robot-use promotion; no AI or robot governance rules.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
