   "Commerce and Information Policy Bureau handles production and distribution of machinery that are robots, and coordination of robot use.",
   "Innovation and Environment Bureau handles standards and certification system policy and industrial standardization.",
   "Product Safety Division enforces the Consumer Product Safety Act.",
   "Amended by Cabinet Order No. 247 of Reiwa 8 (August 2026)."
